{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec2b6f850a38c18bff9b2d860b248982102966e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are three non-zero integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a7fe0d93c57348d1029a7fd96cf057b2ee16a22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/68867ee7b08e34c84bd7054c465e0b101d58f786.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{p} + \\frac{1}{q} + \\frac{1}{r} + \\frac{360}{pqr} = 1\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"41\" />\nCompute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/63795f5ae81b5558afc51ffd1b2e8a7a30d38f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pqr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec3647dd60207d25316e20a3501fbd713366834.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac {1}{p} + \\frac {1}{q} + \\frac {1}{r} + \\frac {360}{pqr} &amp; = 1 \\\\ pq + pr + qr + 360 &amp; =  pqr \\\\ 360 &amp; =  pqr - pq - pr - qr \\\\  &amp; =  (p - 1)(q - 1)(r - 1) - (p + q + r) + 1 \\\\  &amp; =  (p - 1)(q - 1)(r - 1) - 25 \\\\ 385 &amp; =  (p - 1)(q - 1)(r - 1) \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"473\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p>From here, you can factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/72864d6940ce0fce24675857208b1fa412393962.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$385$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/d/4dd4a3ee033662cdd95de1f1ce6349c8029284bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, giving corresponding values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c18fd74d523db75661a5b497cee1f44492933ac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6, 8,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/388f540ffb721281e48258f92d81a33bb2cbbc94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 8 \\cdot 12=576$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035849\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 125/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1424/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 182/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2238/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.103      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.103      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6604:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035849 and revision id 33620. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}